    "detailed_description": "<strong>!!!THIS GAME HAS BODY HORROR, GORE AND TRYPOPHOBIA WARNING!!!</strong><br>You're just a normal Captain, trying to finish your cargo run and earn some well-deserved shore leave. <br>Your crew is solid, even if you have a newbie onboard. You've done this dozens of times. <br><br><i>Oh? A new toy to play with.</i><br><br>All you have to do is visit this last outpost, and you'll be done for a good, long, while. <br>One more jump. <br>One more Sale.<br><br><i>We'll see about that.</i><br><br>After all, this is just a normal run...<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Voice Acting</strong><br><br></li><li><strong>Handdrawn Backgrounds and Art</strong><br><br></li><li><strong>Amazing Soundtrack</strong> by the talented Keno Nifty!<br><br></li><li><strong>Time Loop Mechanics</strong><br><br></li><li><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> <br><br></li><li><strong>A Dating Sim Mode?</strong>Of course not. That would be silly</li></ul><br>Loosely inspired by Junji Ito's &quot;Hellstar Remina&quot;, this game immerses you in a nightmare where an eldritch planet hungers for your very essence. Will you succumb to the insidious influence of the eldritch planet, or can you find a way to break free from the cyclical nightmare?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>!!!THIS GAME HAS BODY HORROR, GORE AND TRYPOPHOBIA WARNING!!!</strong><br>You're just a normal Captain, trying to finish your cargo run and earn some well-deserved shore leave. <br>Your crew is solid, even if you have a newbie onboard. You've done this dozens of times. <br><br><i>Oh? A new toy to play with.</i><br><br>All you have to do is visit this last outpost, and you'll be done for a good, long, while. <br>One more jump. <br>One more Sale.<br><br><i>We'll see about that.</i><br><br>After all, this is just a normal run...<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Voice Acting</strong><br><br></li><li><strong>Handdrawn Backgrounds and Art</strong><br><br></li><li><strong>Amazing Soundtrack</strong> by the talented Keno Nifty!<br><br></li><li><strong>Time Loop Mechanics</strong><br><br></li><li><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> <br><br></li><li><strong>A Dating Sim Mode?</strong>Of course not. That would be silly</li></ul><br>Loosely inspired by Junji Ito's &quot;Hellstar Remina&quot;, this game immerses you in a nightmare where an eldritch planet hungers for your very essence. Will you succumb to the insidious influence of the eldritch planet, or can you find a way to break free from the cyclical nightmare?",
